# Line endings.
#
# The repo stores text as LF; `core.autocrlf=true` on a Windows clone then
# writes CRLF into the working copy, which is what made `prettier --check` fail
# on ~200 untouched files during `npm run precheck`. `eol=lf` pins the checkout
# so every platform sees the same bytes, and Prettier's `endOfLine: "auto"`
# tolerates a working copy that predates this file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must never translate.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
